    "YEXIO Dorfen's government event report is March 2. Other discovered first-party indexes identify February 2026; this packet does not resolve or invent the exact event day because both lie outside the window.",
    "YEXIO Bad Lippspringe's visible release label is April 2025; metadata identifies April 9, 2025. The planned summer 2026 finish is neither actual completion nor a fresh work observation. A March 13, 2026 corporate social post found in search is also stale and was not captured or selected.",
    "The July 20 municipal roadworks at Funkenbergstrasse concern transport, sidewalks, cycle lanes and bus-station access. Proximity to the FunkenbergQuarter does not make those works part of the data-center construction scope.",
    "YEXIO Heiligenhaus appeared as previously opened September 2025 in first-party search results, while Graz and Brake appeared as speculative directory/grant leads. Those search-only leads are not captured lifecycle evidence, exact site identities or additional selected campuses."
